'''Best of the Best Milestone Edition''' (DL記念選抜ガチャ, ''Daunrōdo Kinen Senbatsu Gacha'', '''DL Celebration Selection Gacha''') is a [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] event added in [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]]. It features [[Metal Maiden Koneko (Uber Rare Cat)|Metal Maiden Koneko]] along with selected Uber Rare units from the regular Rare Capsule events in addition to all of the non-collab [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare]] units.

==Chances==
{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 5%
|SuperChance = 25%
|RareChance = 69.3%
|LegendChance = 0.7%
}}

